===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A sociable person.
# {{lb|en|historical}} A four-wheeled open [[carriage]] with seats facing each other.
# A [[bicycle]] or [[tricycle]] for two persons side by side.
# A [[couch]] with a curved S-shaped back.
# {{lb|en|US}} An [[informal]] [[party]] or [[church]] [[meeting]] for purposes of [[socialize|socializing]].
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1903|author=George Horace Lorimer|title=Letters from a Self-Made Merchant to his Son|page=46
|passage=At the church '''sociables''' he used to hop around among them, chipping and chirping like a dicky-bird picking up seed; and he was a great hand to play the piano, and sing saddish, sweetish songs to them.}}

